# Text that is not UTF-8 (ISO 8859-1 here), in each place that goes out
# labelled UTF-8 and that an application can fill with any bytes: the
# subject, a display name, the text and an attachment's name.  (The HTML
# version is checked too, but a page that Ur/Web renders is UTF-8.)
api=check
form=(From=$'J\xfcrgen <j@example.com>' To=bob@example.net Subject=$'Gr\xfc\xdfe' Body=$'Gr\xfc\xdfe'
      Attach1=$'blob|Gr\xfc\xdfe.txt|text/plain|x')
